# Map UI -- a Lua-drawn world map.
#
# Proof of concept. One player script: the map is drawn from data the
# player context can already reach, and the whole mod is a window plus a
# registry of the layers drawn into it.

# Owns the keybinding, the window, and the MapUI interface that other
# mods register layers through. Player context because openmw.ui and
# openmw.input are unreachable anywhere else.
PLAYER: scripts/MapUI/player.lua
